[2026-10-18T14:56:30.003Z] [INFO]   "bodyPreview": "{\"info\":{\"id\":\"msg_14f83294e001FcVYTU7nrDYSUJ\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_eb07d51d0ffe0RUH0mF3eT5sO2\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"time\":{\"created\":1792335358286,\"completed\":1792335389965},\"parentID\":\"msg_14f82ae3c001ilgMD6wnKHj2X7\",\"modelID\":\"formal-ai\",\"providerID\":\"formalai\",\"mode\":\"build\",\"path\":{\"cwd\":\"/tmp/gh-issue-solver-1792335256611\",\"root\":\"/tmp/gh-issue-solver-1792335256611\"},\"cost\":0,\"tokens\":{\"input\":26447,\"output\":2314,\"reasoning\":0,\"cache\":{\"read\":0,\"write\":0}},\"finish\":\"stop\"},\"parts\":[{\"id\":\"prt_14f83a26600192Tgg8LHW9CJfX\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_eb07d51d0ffe0RUH0mF3eT5sO2\",\"messageID\":\"msg_14f83294e001FcVYTU7nrDYSUJ\",\"type\":\"step-start\",\"snapshot\":\"fbfd77d8a0f5931e1a0818801541b74e690bb87d\"},{\"id\":\"prt_14f83a267001KIWjcn5qO5YIlD\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_eb07d51d0ffe0RUH0mF3eT5sO2\",\"messageID\":\"msg_14f83294e001FcVYTU7nrDYSUJ\",\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Planificado, no ejecutado: https://github.com/link-assistant/formal-ai/issues/1235.\\n\\nEl trabajo solicitado sigue sin verificarse. El plan siguiente describe pasos previstos; escribir o leer un registro del plan no verifica la entrega. Plan:\\n\\n```lino\\ngeneral_change_plan\\n  id \\\"repository_work_item_plan_6756be1d93f5b129\\\"\\n  execution_mode \\\"repository_work_item\\\"\\n  terminal_state \\\"planned_not_executed\\\"\\n  goal \\\"JavaScript: expose provenance-preserving categorical evidence assessment for legal reasoning\\\\n\\\\nThe JavaScript relative meta-logic component at fd5…ca3 aggregates probabilistic evidence, but legal source absence, contradictions and contextual applicability need an explicit categorical interface.\\\\n\\\\nDownstream work: https://github.com/link-assistant/legal/pull/2 (issue https://github.com/link-assistant/legal/issues/1).\\\\n\\\\nProposed addition: assessLegalContext(evidence) returning supported / contradicted / conflict / unknown, with provenance labels. Empty input must remain unknown; opposing source stances must remain a conflict. A probability must not be presented as proof of legal validity.\\\\n\\\\nWe are developing a patch against js/agentic/crate/relative_meta_logic.mjs in the downstream PR, kept as a patch with the pinned source checksum, and deterministic tests for exceptions, missing facts, dates, jurisdiction, conflicting rules and source drift. Executable rules require reviewed semantics and exact source spans. Surface modal extraction is explicitly unverified. This does not claim to solve arbitrary legal reasoning.\\\\n\\\\nUpstream incorporation would remove the temporary patch and support other deterministic applications. Broader automatic semantic formalization of legislation remains an unresolved capability requirement.\\\"\\n  target \\\"https://github.com/link-assistant/formal-ai/issues/1235\\\"\\n  step 1\\n    capability \\\"Fetch\\\"\\n    action \\\"read the referenced work item at https://github.com/link-assistant/formal-ai/issues/1235 before planning any change\\\"\\n    expected_evidence \\\"the work-item text naming the artifact the change must produce\\\"\\n  step 2\\n    capability \\\"Write\\\"\\n    action \\\"append the bounded repository work-item plan to .formal-ai/general-change-plan.lino\\\"\\n    expected_evidence \\\"the exact repository work-item goal and execution boundary\\\"\\n```\",\"time\":{\"start\":1792335389287,\"end\":1792335389287}},{\"id\":\"prt_14f83a2690019CiJj0bh9m3POi\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_eb07d51d0ffe0RUH0mF3eT5sO2\",\"messageID\":\"msg_14f83294e001FcVYTU7nrDYSUJ\",\"type\":\"step-finish\",\"reason\":\"stop\",\"snapshot\":\"fbfd77d8a0f5931e1a0818801541b74e690bb87d\",\"cost\":0,\"tokens\":{\"input\":26447,\"output\":2314,\"reasoning\":0,\"cache\":{\"read\":0,\"write\":0}},\"model\":{\"providerID\":\"formalai\",\"requestedModelID\":\"formal-ai\",\"respondedModelID\":\"formal-ai\"},\"context\":{\"contextLimit\":40051552256,\"outputLimit\":8192,\"usableContext\":40051544064,\"safeLimit\":30038658048,\"safetyMargin\":0.75,\"currentTokens\":28761,\"headroom\":30038629287,\"overflow\":false}}]}",
